1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,355
Waiting on your working holiday visa?

2
00:00:02,355 --> 00:00:04,822
Don't book that flight yet. Here's why.

3
00:00:04,922 --> 00:00:09,065
One. Average processing is expected to be around three months.

4
00:00:09,165 --> 00:00:11,993
Two. You must be in the right place when it's granted.

5
00:00:11,993 --> 00:00:14,482
Applied in Australia? Be in Australia.

6
00:00:14,482 --> 00:00:17,513
Applied from overseas? Be outside Australia.

7
00:00:17,613 --> 00:00:20,332
Three. Wait for the grant before booking flights,

8
00:00:20,332 --> 00:00:22,655
or locking in work or study plans.

9
00:00:22,755 --> 00:00:25,567
Send this to a mate who's waiting on their visa.

